# Mutt round: skip to round 6 with the debug menu and see the Mutt round: the MUTT ROUND banner and 16 MUTTS LEFT.
# The debug KILL ALL ZOMBIES and SKIP BREAK buttons only set up the late round. The proof is what round 6 shows.
debug GOD MODE
debug KILL ALL ZOMBIES
until hud.break true 60
debug SKIP BREAK
until hud.round 2 60
debug KILL ALL ZOMBIES
until hud.break true 60
debug SKIP BREAK
until hud.round 3 60
debug KILL ALL ZOMBIES
until hud.break true 60
debug SKIP BREAK
until hud.round 4 60
debug KILL ALL ZOMBIES
until hud.break true 60
debug SKIP BREAK
until hud.round 5 60
debug KILL ALL ZOMBIES
until hud.break true 60
debug SKIP BREAK
until hud.round 6 60
expect hud.objective 16 MUTTS LEFT
wait 5
state 01-mutt-round
shot 01-mutt-round
until zombies.alive 16 1200
wait 60
aim
shot 02-mutts
